      "created_at": "2015-04-19T13:54:09.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Something that occured to me - would it be possible to create a 'campaign mode' which would take you through the canon encounters in chronological order so you'd get the story of the Sentinels universe? I figure this would be a great way to learn all the lore of the multiverse, as you could also unlock the story of what happens between encounters. I'm hoping that something like this is made for the physical game (A Sentinel COmics Compendium?), but it would still be awesome if only in the app version. That said, I realise it's probably a hell of a lot of work!</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
